# --- game data and key material -----------------------------------------
# A convenience default for THIS repository. Your own project may legitimately
# want these tracked: set "allow_game_data": true in hanpatch.json and drop
# whatever you want from this list. See NOTICE.md.
# ROMs and images
*.cia
*.cci
*.3ds
*.cxi
*.nds
*.iso
*.bin
# extracted containers and per-project working data
extracted/
work/
build/
dist/
# a project's own config points at a ROM
/hanpatch.json
# key material: yours, from your own hardware. never ours to ship.
keys/
boot9*.bin
seeddb.bin
keys.txt
aes_keys.txt
encTitleKeys.bin
*.dec
# fonts are licensed separately; bring your own
fonts/
*.ttf
*.otf
*.bcfnt
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# agent session state, not source
.gjc/

# A title profile carries that title's own terminology. The pipeline facts in it
# (engine_wraps, budget, font_charset, register_default, hard_terms) are the reusable
# part; the bulk `terms` map is an extract of a copyrighted script and is deliberately
# NOT published here. `hanpatch` regenerates it from a ROM the operator already owns -
# see the anchor procedure in skills/hanpatch. To publish your own, drop this line.
/profiles/dq7.json
